SUMMARY:Jazz & Gin: A 1920's Themed Party
DESCRIPTION:Hey\, ya Toots!\nThrow on your best flapper dress or bowler hat and shimmy over to our place for a party straight outta 1923. The Groove Ridge Collective will delight us in jumpin’ jazz jives while we sip tasty bevs from our friends at Chemist Distilling. A prize will go to the best-dressed gal or guy\, so get all dolled up! \nThis event is free to attend. \nSeeya soon.
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/jazz-gin-a-1920s-themed-party/
CATEGORIES:Free & Fun!
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/IG-Murder-Mystery-1.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=881a85f293144ca55fd6df6fd203b265
END:VEVENT
