UID:10001952-1793484000-1793489400@devilsfootbrew.com
SUMMARY:Your Allure Presents: kLL sMTH with Black Carl!\, Player1\, & Secret Special Guests
DESCRIPTION:Join us for kLL sMTH. + Black Carl!\, Spirit Player1\, & Secret Special Guests Saturday\, October 31st at Devil’s Foot in Asheville\, NC\nOur debut at The Mule at Devil’s Foot kicks off this Halloween! We plan to be outdoors but will pivot to indoors if we have bad weather or freeing temps. \nExpect a carefully curated fully immersive experience from start to finish showcasing high-fidelity BASSBOSS sound\, vibrant visuals on our high definition 2.9 pixel pitch LED wall\, and a state-of-the-art laser & light show. \nEnjoy several food and craft vendors including an Italian pop-up from our good friends at Tony’s all inside a community-driven-mini-festival atmosphere. Come dance\, explore\, game\, and connect! This is more than just a concert\, it’s an intentional gathering of sound\, art\, and culture curated by Your Allure at The Mule at Devil’s Foot! \n10pm-2am \n Tickets & Info Here!
URL:https://devilsfootbrew.com/event-detail/kll-smth-with-black-carl/
CATEGORIES:Hosting with Friends,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://craftpeak-cooler-images.imgix.net/devils-foot-beverage-company/Screenshot-2026-10-20-at-12.16.19-PM.png?auto=compress%2Cformat&ixlib=php-3.3.1&s=b045df2582fd292d28d5cb1ad875ee05
END:VEVENT
